y. The signing ceremony was held with the aims of (1) strengthening the cooperation between the two institutions in providing short- and long-term courses on Networking and Cloud Computing skills, (2) providing internship opportunities and scholarships for Cambodian students, and (3) co-organizing professional training, workshops, and exhibitions as well. The two institutions also aim to collaborate on research and innovation projects. <span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0em;\">CamTech University and Huawei Technologies (Cambodia) have a common vision for the development of human resources in Cambodia in the field of science and technology.<\/span><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-61c4a7fa elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"61c4a7fa\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3bdcfe1a\" data-id=\"3bdcfe1a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b5108ef elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"4b5108ef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section 